@startuml
title From an underwater borrower to a lower share price
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A78B5
}
participant Oracle
participant "Blue market" as B
participant "Vault V2" as V
participant "Informed depositor" as E
participant Liquidator as L
Oracle -> B : collateral price falls
note over B, V : borrower underwater, nothing recorded
E -> V : withdraw at the pre-loss price
L -> B : liquidate, collateral short of the debt
B -> B : bad debt written off
note over V : totalAssets() < _totalAssets
V -> V : next entry point calls accrueInterest
note over V : remaining holders carry the loss
@enduml
